  <running_head>De Moralitate</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">
      <i>sunt charitatis aut præsentis necessitatis: &amp;</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2">
      <i>ab omnibus recreationibus, quæ Dei cultum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3">
      <i>impediunt.</i> --- Diligenter notandum,</l>
    <l n="4">quòd Synodus ne <i>recreationem</i> quidem</l>
    <l n="5">tollat. Confer Nehem. VIII, 10, --13.</l>
    <l n="6" para="true">Resp. 1. Ad <i>observationem populo Ju-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7">
      <i>daico peculiariter præscriptam</i>, certè etiàm</l>
    <l n="8">pertinet juge Sacrificium, tùm matutinum,</l>
    <l n="9">tùm vespertinum, &amp; quidem utrumque</l>
    <l n="10">duplicatum; <i>Num.</i> XXVIII, 3, --10. Et</l>
    <l n="11">peculiaris quædam quies præscripta in</l>
    <l n="12">Mannâ non ipso Sabbatho, sed pridiè,</l>
    <l n="13">coquendâ; <i>Exod.</i> XVI, 23. atque item, Igne</l>
    <l n="14">periftum diem in tentoriis non accen-</l>
    <l n="15">dendo; <i>cap.</i> XXXV, 3. Accedebat rigi-</l>
    <l n="16">da iftius Præcepti, ut &amp; reliquorum pro</l>
    <l n="17">re natâ, sub istâ œconomiâ exactio, ac</l>
    <l n="18">dura sanctio pœnalis; <i>Num.</i> XV, 32, --36.</l>
    <l n="19">Quietem ad cultum Dei sanctamque e-</l>
    <l n="20">jus praxin statuo quodam die necessariam,</l>
    <l n="21">Synodus etiàm Novo T. adscribit; deter-</l>
    <l n="22">minatam illam septimi diei à creatione,</l>
    <l n="23">ac rigidam observationem V. T. propriam</l>
    <l n="24">attribuit.</l>
    <l n="25" para="true">2. Atque sic nos defendimus &amp; ad-</l>
    <l n="26">struimus veritatem iftius assertionis Syno-</l>
    <l n="27">dalis. 3. Illud</l>
